on in ["Debian", "Ubuntu"]\n      - java_open_jdk_version | int < 11\n\n  - name: Correct java version selected (Debian, Java >= 11)\n    alternatives:\n      name: java\n      path: "/usr/lib/jvm/java-11-openjdk-amd64/jre/bin/java"\n      state: present\n    when:\n      - ansible_distribution in ["Debian", "Ubuntu"]\n      - java_open_jdk_version | int >= 11\n```' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'gemma3:27b', 'created_at': '2025-10-21T09:07:04.669090381Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 82635645869, 'load_duration': 225089043, 'prompt_eval_count': 2476, 'prompt_eval_duration': 8160999047, 'eval_count': 1233, 'eval_duration': 74248494181, 'model_name': 'gemma3:27b'} id='run--71c66a04-5ca7-49fb-80f7-698f520aa350-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 2476, 'output_tokens': 1233, 'total_tokens': 3709}
