: rke2_cni == \'none\' and (inventory_hostname == groups[\'rke2_server\'][0] or inventory_hostname == groups[\'rke2_first_server\'][0])\n\n- name: Wait for remaining nodes to be ready - with CNI\n  shell: kubectl get nodes -o wide | grep "Ready" | wc -l\n  register: node_ready_cni\n  until: node_ready_cni.stdout == "{{ rke2_node_count }}"\n  retries: 30\n  delay: 10\n  when: rke2_cni != \'none\' and (inventory_hostname == groups[\'rke2_server\'][0] or inventory_hostname == groups[\'rke2_first_server\'][0])\n```' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'gemma3:27b', 'created_at': '2025-10-21T10:08:03.849720811Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 60254804418, 'load_duration': 209295928, 'prompt_eval_count': 1962, 'prompt_eval_duration': 6734763490, 'eval_count': 876, 'eval_duration': 53309651288, 'model_name': 'gemma3:27b'} id='run--cb0f1be6-8947-442d-bc3b-393806f3ba5d-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 1962, 'output_tokens': 876, 'total_tokens': 2838}
